Comment: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:11:35.81,0:11:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,==OP/ED/TITLE==
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the precious bottle I got by passing Ioryogi's test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When this bottle is filled, my wish will be granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and I'll be able to go to that place, right, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder when it'll fill up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who's supposed to fill it, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just getting the bottle doesn't mean anything, okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you filling that bottle with!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People's scarred hearts, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you need to do to collect those!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I must heal their scarred hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you've got the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So let's get collecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I forgot to mention one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't talk to me when there are people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since you lack any memory, knowledge, or common sense, I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stuffed animals don't talk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You understand that talking to things that can't talk back is weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't they talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because they're stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't stuffed animals talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!  I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't just suddenly get off the see-saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone here scarred?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do any of you want to be healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are any of you scarred?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me heal your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No thanks, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!  Is there anything I can do to heal you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything I can do to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors!  Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, lady, help us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can be it when we play kick the can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?  Will it help you if I'm it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick the can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, that's funny.  There's nothing in here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How does being it in kick the can heal anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There isn't anyone whose heart would be healed by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not doing anything but being a playmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.15,0:04:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's pretty tough to just run into someone who wants to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if there's no one that wants to be hurt, that means there's no one sad, no one scarred!  It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:05:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, you think positive about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be great if I could find a way to help out...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...  Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're giving this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To be able to just walk up to someone and give them something wonderful like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a wonderful person!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.09,0:05:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've gotta reel a few more people in...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be great if you'd take as many as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?  Then I'll take them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.71,0:05:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!  You're a real help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not only did I help him out, I got plenty of something wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna do with all of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:06:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now it's my turn to give everyone something this wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!  Have some wonderful tissues!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're sure to be useful!  Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give you plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've already got plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, go right ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!  Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have some wonderful tissues!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, you're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit screwing around in the middle of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That person...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,from before...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Clean up the tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:07:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!  Let me thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he's over here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sheets went flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her nose has a scrape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, stop laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.13,0:07:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Yomogi Nursery.  I work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've so few people working that I have to do the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have many workers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's inconveniencing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would having more people help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would it help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, take these!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Toshihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a funny name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a funny name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So your dad must be Ohbato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's he named?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's he named?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's he named?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have a dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then his name doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go on a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay out of her way, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...  What should I help out with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep them occupied like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep them occupied...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we can all dance together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can dance!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mr. Kiyokazu, come play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna dance with Miss Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...  Kobato then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing following me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.  Now go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.21,0:10:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm helping out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't even play the organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you two are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Fujimoto Kiyokazu.  You'll be working with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And this is Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try to get along today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:11:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on and play the organ, Mr. Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up, teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'm leaving this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's such a meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this where they live?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't live here, we just take care of them during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's kind of old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a new nursery nearby too, so fewer and fewer kids are coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've gotta do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there's no point in just worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.07,0:12:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.  You really helped us out, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The kids had a lot of fun with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:13:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, I just played with them!  That kind of thing always drives Ioryogi up the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!  Ioryogi's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!  He's the stuffed animal I always carry around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was carrying him around because he can't talk to come get me! {*}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, should I come back tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know where she lives or what she's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do we really want her around the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like you don't know!  I'm Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really think your name is a good enough answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm--!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.45,0:13:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Trying to figure it out myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can, we'd love to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we can't really pay you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!  If I can help out, that's more than enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.99,0:14:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just doing this out of pity or self-sacrifice, stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thinking "poor us" or "it's so tough" is just annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get in the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get in the way, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like leaving me behind in the middle of town all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit being glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what would've happened if someone had walked off with me!?{*}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you?  I'm a stuffed animal here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.43,0:15:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stuffed animals don't just walk off on their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind the bottle, you forgot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, you knew it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really expect anything in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what I did didn't heal anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just annoyed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto seemed so scarred, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he said I was annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it varies from person to person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's both scarred and unscarred people out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but out of the people that are scarred,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know there were both people who wanted and who didn't want to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you wanna heal him, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter if you should or shouldn't, worry about that after you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.10,0:17:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does the nursery send kids home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I'm not going yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like swings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I've gotta wait here a little more before Mom comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She has work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Work, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But she's a hard worker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though she's been having a hard time since the divorce, she makes me breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's nice!  Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you going to say she's no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is your mom late again, Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.  You're so wise, not being selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again, Toshihiko?  You're such a good boy waiting patiently like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too bad your mother doesn't care a little more for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe she's working herself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone says I have a bad mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That mom's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A no-good mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong!  Mom's a hard worker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!  She's really great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.30,0:19:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's wonderful to have such a great, hard-working mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!  She's a wonderful mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.77,0:20:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's filling up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.65,0:20:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's from that boy Toshihiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick, Kobato!{*}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.27,0:21:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko, you're great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was so happy that you were kind to him and praised his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...  I was kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you've got ulterior motives, just being kind won't heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should keep doing what you did there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best to collect people's scarred hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds like you're scarring them yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.59,0:21:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...  Their healed hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That makes it sound like you're snatching them away right after healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.89,0:22:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...  What should I call these?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop bothering me about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They look like candy, call 'em that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Candy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!  I'll call these candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Abandoning me is inexcusable, but what came before that was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.64,0:22:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm giving you 100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.65,0:22:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it up, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.84,0:22:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get carried away just because you scored 100!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you said to keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.37,0:22:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.13,0:22:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind!  No 100 for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.84,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:51.16,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:01:00.96,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:06.74,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:14.52,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:20.20,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:25.38,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:31.70,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:37.35,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:44.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.09,0:01:52.80,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(918,1001)\pos(424,166)}... Sparkling candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:07.77,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:15.28,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.86,0:23:23.30,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.87,0:23:31.95,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:42.95,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.30,0:23:45.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.18,0:23:54.06,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you say it thankfully, if you do it thankfully
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:24:01.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Together, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:10.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.77,0:24:14.83,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.57,0:24:27.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... Gift of the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.24,0:23:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
